{"id":"c6d785e6b3507274","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-universal-sentence-preservation.md","title":"Universal Preservation Theorem","display":"thm-universal-sentence-preservation — Universal Preservation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-universal-sentence-preservation","aliases":["17-thm-universal-sentence-preservation"],"display":"thm-universal-sentence-preservation — Universal Preservation Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-universal-theory]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]"],"source_section":"3.2","source_result":"Local single-sentence corollary of Theorem 3.2.2","source_pages_print":[149],"source_pages_djvu":[165],"source_verification":"theory-level statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; compactness gives a finite universal conjunction","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-5.2.2b","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-universal-sentence-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-universal-sentence-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-sentence-preservation — Universal Preservation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"262cf6e0c0418727\" href=\"?note=262cf6e0c0418727\" title=\"17-df-universal-theory\">17-df-universal-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local single-sentence corollary of Theorem 3.2.2"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>165</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"theory-level statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; compactness gives a finite universal conjunction"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.2.2b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为待检验句子。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\)</span> (universal sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"262cf6e0c0418727\" href=\"?note=262cf6e0c0418727\" title=\"17-df-universal-theory\">17-df-universal-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (truth in a structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L\\)</span> (substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theorem characterizes sentences preserved downward to substructures. It does not identify the set of universal consequences of a theory with the theory itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-universal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"262cf6e0c0418727","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-universal-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L